---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/ADUIcon.astro';
import Photo from '../components/ADUPhoto.astro';
import photos from '../data/adu-photos.json';
import { benefits, types, reasons, steps, reviews, faqs, gallery } from '../data/adu';
import '../styles/adu.css';
const brands=[{name:'Google',src:'theabcpro-adu-google-reviews.png'},{name:'Yelp',src:'theabcpro-adu-yelp-reviews.svg'},{name:'Houzz',src:'theabcpro-adu-houzz-reviews.png'},{name:'Nextdoor',src:'theabcpro-adu-nextdoor-reviews.png'}];
---
<Layout title="Local ADU Builders in Los Angeles | TheABCPro" description="Custom ADUs, garage conversions and additions in Los Angeles. Start with a free ADU estimate and 3D design for qualifying projects." preloadImage={photos["hero-interior"].full} ogImage="/assets/og/og-adu.jpg" showStickyBar={true} disableGTM={true}>
 <style is:global>
  @media (max-width:1200px) {
   body:has(.adu-page) .sticky-btn-call { background:#FDBD2E; color:#271D3E !important; border-color:#FDBD2E; }
   body:has(.adu-page) .sticky-btn-call:active { background:#e6a81d; }
  }
 </style>
 <div class="adu-page">
  <a class="adu-skip" href="#adu-main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="adu-header">
   <a class="adu-brand" href="#" aria-label="TheABCPro — Abraham Building & Consulting"><img src="/assets/adu/theabcpro-adu-company-logo.webp" alt="TheABCPro | Abraham Building & Consulting" width="84" height="84" /></a>
   <div class="adu-header-actions"><a class="adu-header-phone" href="tel:8184573390">(818) 457-3390</a><a class="adu-btn adu-header-estimate" href="#lead-form">Request My Free Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple adu-header-call" href="tel:8184573390"><Icon name="phone" /> Call Now</a></div>
  </header>
  <main id="adu-main">
   <section class="adu-hero" aria-labelledby="adu-title">
    <Photo class="adu-hero-photo" name="hero-interior" alt="Completed detached ADU with a gabled roof, private entrance and poolside patio in Santa Monica" width={3072} height={1728} sizes="100vw" eager />
    <div class="adu-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="adu-hero-grid adu-container">
     <div class="adu-hero-copy">
      <p class="adu-eyebrow">Custom ADUs • Garage Conversions • Additions</p>
      <h1 id="adu-title">Local ADU Builders!<br />More Space.<br /><em>More Possibilities.</em></h1>
      <div class="adu-hero-intro"><p>Turn your garage or backyard into a separate living space that can generate rental income, increase your property’s value, or keep family close with more privacy.</p><p>TheABCPro brings your ADU project together, from planning and 3D design to permit coordination, construction, and your final walkthrough.</p></div>
      <div class="adu-review-label"><span>Trusted by local homeowners</span></div>
      <div class="adu-review-brands" aria-label="Google, Yelp, Houzz and Nextdoor">{brands.map(b=><img src={`/assets/adu/${b.src}`} alt={b.name} width="120" height="38" />)}</div>
      <ul class="adu-hero-benefits"><li><Icon name="check" />Create an opportunity for long-term rental income.</li><li><Icon name="check" />Add living space that can increase your property’s value.</li><li><Icon name="check" />Make room for family without moving.</li></ul>
      <p class="adu-offer">Free Estimate + Free 3D Design for Qualifying Projects</p>
      <a class="adu-btn adu-btn-gold adu-hero-cta" href="#lead-form">Schedule a Consultation <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
      <p class="adu-small adu-hero-note">No obligation. Start with your property and goals—not finished plans.</p>
      <a class="adu-hero-talk" href="tel:8184573390">Prefer to talk? Call (818) 457-3390.</a>
     </div>
     <div class="adu-estimate" id="lead-form">
      <p class="adu-eyebrow adu-form-eyebrow">Your next chapter starts here</p>
      <h2>Get My Free<br class="adu-form-break" /> ADU Estimate</h2>
      <p class="adu-form-intro">Tell us where you want to build and what you have in mind. We’ll contact you to discuss your project and next steps.</p>
      <form data-adu-form method="post">
       <div class="adu-form-trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
       <label>Full Name<input name="name" placeholder="Your full name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" /></label>
       <label>Phone Number<input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Best number to reach you" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="40" /></label>
       <label>Email Address<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180" /></label>
       <label>Property ZIP Code<input name="zip" placeholder="ZIP code where you want to build" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" pattern="[0-9]{5}" minlength="5" maxlength="5" required title="Enter a five-digit ZIP code" /></label>
       <label>Project Type<select name="project_type" required><option value="" disabled selected>Choose an option</option><option>Garage Conversion</option><option>Detached ADU</option><option>Attached ADU</option><option>Junior ADU / JADU</option><option>Not Sure Yet</option></select></label>
       <button class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple adu-submit" type="submit"><span>Request My Free ADU Estimate</span><Icon name="arrow" /></button>
       <p class="adu-form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
       <p class="adu-small adu-form-note">No obligation to proceed. You do not need plans to get started.</p>
      </form>
     </div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <div class="adu-mobile-interior"><Photo name="mobile-kitchen" alt="Long Beach ADU kitchen with white cabinets, a marble-look breakfast bar and pendant lighting" width={3840} height={2558} sizes="(max-width:1200px) 100vw, 1px" /></div>
   <section class="adu-metrics" aria-label="Experience and credentials"><div class="adu-container adu-metrics-grid">{[{value:'80+',label:'remodeling projects completed'},{value:'40+',label:'years of combined contracting experience'},{value:'35+',label:'5-star Google Reviews'},{value:'25+',label:'trusted and vetted partners'}].map(m=><div><strong>{m.value}</strong><span>{m.label}</span></div>)}</div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-gallery-section" aria-labelledby="adu-gallery-title">
    <div class="adu-container"><div class="adu-section-heading"><p class="adu-eyebrow">The possibilities, made real</p><h2 id="adu-gallery-title">See the Space.<br />Understand the Transformation.</h2><p>Explore how a garage or underused part of a property can become a place to live—not just extra square footage.</p></div>
     <div class="adu-gallery">{gallery.map((g,i)=><button class="adu-gallery-item" type="button" data-photo={photos[g.image as keyof typeof photos].full} data-caption={`${g.title} · ${g.location}`} aria-label={`View ${g.title} in ${g.location}`}><Photo name={g.image} alt={g.alt} width={g.width} height={g.height} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 75vw, 50vw" /><span class="adu-gallery-overlay"><span><small>{g.location}</small><strong>{g.title}</strong></span><span class="adu-gallery-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></span></button>)}</div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-benefits-section" aria-labelledby="adu-benefits-title"><div class="adu-container adu-benefits-layout">
    <div class="adu-benefit-photo"><Photo name="living" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 45vw" alt="Light-filled ADU living space with recessed lighting, white walls and polished concrete flooring" width={3840} height={2160} /><div class="adu-photo-note"><Icon name="home-heart" /><span>More room for the life<br />you want to live.</span></div></div>
    <div><p class="adu-eyebrow">Make more of your property</p><h2 id="adu-benefits-title">Your Property Can Offer More Than a Place to Live.</h2><p class="adu-lead">An ADU can give you another way to use the property you already own. Build for income, family, or a combination of today’s needs and tomorrow’s plans.</p>
     <div class="adu-benefits-list">{benefits.map(b=><article><Icon name={b.icon} /><div><h3>{b.title}</h3><p>{b.text}</p></div></article>)}</div>
     <p class="adu-small adu-disclaimer">Rental income and property-value gains depend on your property, project, and local market. Neither is guaranteed.</p><a class="adu-text-link" href="#adu-types">Explore My ADU Options <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
    </div>
   </div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-types-section" id="adu-types" aria-labelledby="adu-types-title"><div class="adu-container">
    <div class="adu-section-heading"><p class="adu-eyebrow">A space that fits your plans</p><h2 id="adu-types-title">Which ADU Fits Your Property?</h2><p>A garage conversion and a new backyard ADU are different projects. Start with the option closest to your idea—or let us help you compare them.</p></div>
    <div class="adu-types-carousel">
     <div class="adu-types-viewport"><div class="adu-types-grid">{types.map((t,i)=><article class="adu-type-card"><div class="adu-type-top"><Icon name={t.icon} /><span>0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{t.title}</h3><p>{t.text}</p><a class="adu-type-link" href="#lead-form" data-project-type={t.value}>{t.button}<Icon name="arrow" /></a></article>)}</div></div>
     <div class="adu-types-controls">
      <button class="adu-types-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous ADU type"><Icon name="arrow" /></button>
      <div class="adu-type-dots">{types.map((t,i)=><button type="button" data-type-slide={i} aria-label={`Show ${t.title}`} aria-current={i===0?'true':'false'}></button>)}</div>
      <button class="adu-types-next" type="button" aria-label="Next ADU type"><Icon name="arrow" /></button>
      <button class="adu-types-pause" type="button" aria-label="Pause automatic ADU types">Pause</button>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="adu-section-bottom"><p>Not sure which option fits? Tell us how you want to use the space. Feasibility and approvals depend on your property and project.</p><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
   </div></section>
   <section class="adu-project-story" aria-label="Hollywood Hills ADU conversion"><div class="adu-story-photos"><figure><Photo name="construction" alt="Wood framing during the Hollywood Hills historic structure ADU conversion" width={1335} height={2000} /><figcaption>During construction</figcaption></figure><figure><Photo name="historic-kitchen" alt="Completed kitchen in the converted Hollywood Hills ADU, with white cabinets and dark floor tiles" width={1335} height={2000} /><figcaption>Completed interior</figcaption></figure></div><div class="adu-story-copy"><p class="adu-eyebrow">Hollywood Hills · ADU conversion</p><h2>Have a similar project in mind?</h2><p>Tell us about your property.</p><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-gold" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-why" aria-labelledby="adu-why-title"><div class="adu-container"><div class="adu-section-heading"><p class="adu-eyebrow">TheABCPro difference</p><h2 id="adu-why-title">Choose an ADU Team.<br />Not Another Project to Manage.</h2><p>Your ADU needs more than a floor plan. It needs design decisions, permit requirements, and construction work that move together. TheABCPro keeps those stages coordinated so you are not left managing the handoffs yourself.</p></div>
    <div class="adu-reasons-grid">{reasons.map((r,i)=><article><span class="adu-reason-number">0{i+1}</span><Icon name={r.icon} /><h3>{r.title}</h3><p>{r.text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="adu-section-bottom"><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a><p class="adu-small">Understand the project before you commit to construction.</p></div>
   </div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-process" aria-labelledby="adu-process-title"><div class="adu-container"><div class="adu-section-heading"><p class="adu-eyebrow">A clear path forward</p><h2 id="adu-process-title">From ADU Idea to a Project<br />You Can Move Forward With</h2></div><div class="adu-process-grid">{steps.map((s,i)=><article><div class="adu-step-photo"><Photo name={s.image} alt={s.alt} width={s.width} height={s.height} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 33vw" /><span>0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="adu-section-bottom"><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple" href="#lead-form">Start My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a><p class="adu-small">Start with a conversation. Decide whether to proceed after reviewing your options.</p></div></div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-testimonials" aria-labelledby="adu-reviews-title"><div class="adu-container"><div class="adu-section-heading"><p class="adu-eyebrow">In their own words</p><h2 id="adu-reviews-title">Hear From Homeowners Who <br />Chose ABCPro for <span class="adu-review-title-end">Their ADU</span></h2></div>
    <div class="adu-review-carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="ADU homeowner reviews"><div class="adu-testimonial-track">{reviews.map((r,i)=><article class="adu-testimonial" aria-label={`Review ${i+1} of ${reviews.length}`}><div class="adu-review-top"><span class="adu-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><span class="adu-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</span></div><p class="adu-review-type">{r.type}</p><blockquote>{r.quote}</blockquote><div class="adu-review-author"><strong>{r.name}</strong><span>5-star Yelp review</span><time>{r.date}</time><small>Reviewer location: {r.location}</small></div></article>)}</div><div class="adu-carousel-controls"><div class="adu-carousel-dots">{reviews.map((r,i)=><button type="button" aria-label={`Show review ${i+1}`} aria-current={i===0?'true':'false'} data-slide={i}></button>)}</div><button type="button" class="adu-carousel-pause" aria-label="Pause automatic reviews">Pause</button></div></div>
    <div class="adu-section-bottom"><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-purple" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
   </div></section>
   <section class="adu-area" aria-labelledby="adu-area-title"><div class="adu-container adu-area-grid"><div class="adu-area-symbol"><Icon name="pin" /><span>Los Angeles, CA</span></div><div><p class="adu-eyebrow">Built around your property</p><h2 id="adu-area-title">Planning an ADU in Los Angeles?<br />Let’s Talk About Your Property.</h2><p>Tell us where you want to build and which ADU option you are considering. We’ll confirm service coverage and discuss the next step for your property.</p><div class="adu-area-actions"><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-gold" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a href="tel:8184573390">(818) 457-3390</a></div></div></div></section>
   <section class="adu-section adu-faq" aria-labelledby="adu-faq-title"><div class="adu-container adu-faq-layout"><div><p class="adu-eyebrow">A little clarity goes a long way</p><h2 id="adu-faq-title">Frequently<br /> Asked Questions</h2><p>Start with your property and goals—not finished plans.</p><a class="adu-text-link" href="tel:8184573390">Let’s talk about your ADU <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div><div>{faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}<span class="adu-faq-plus"><Icon name="plus" /></span></summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
   <section class="adu-final" aria-labelledby="adu-final-title"><Photo name="finished-kitchen" alt="Completed Long Beach ADU kitchen with a breakfast bar, white cabinetry and wood flooring" width={3840} height={2558} sizes="100vw" /><div class="adu-final-overlay"></div><div class="adu-container adu-final-copy"><p class="adu-eyebrow">Your property. Your possibilities.</p><h2 id="adu-final-title">More Income Potential.<br />More Living Space.<br /><em>More Options for Your Home.</em></h2><p>Whether you want to create a rental opportunity, add value to your property, or make room for family, start by understanding what your ADU project could involve.</p><p>Request your free estimate today and take the next step from an idea to a plan for your property.</p><a class="adu-btn adu-btn-gold" href="#lead-form">Request My Free ADU Estimate <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a class="adu-final-phone" href="tel:8184573390">Call About My ADU: (818) 457-3390</a><p class="adu-small">No obligation. Free 3D Design for qualifying projects.</p></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer style="border-top:2px solid #271D3E;background:#fff;padding:52px 40px 22px">
    <div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:16px">
      <img src="/assets/adu/theabcpro-adu-company-logo.webp" alt="The ABC Pro" style="width:104px;height:104px;object-fit:contain;display:block" />
      <span style="font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.180em;line-height:22px;color:#777">CSLB License #1046696</span>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#777">At Abraham Building & Consulting, we deliver high-quality home remodeling and construction services in Los Angeles. Owned and managed by a family with over 20 years of industry experience, we are qualified to handle all your renovation needs!</p>

    </div>
    
    <p style="margin:36px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#777">
      Abraham Building & Consulting © 2026  |  CSLB License #1046696  |  Privacy Policy  |  Disclaimer
    </p>
  </footer>
  <dialog class="adu-lightbox" aria-label="Project photo"><button class="adu-lightbox-close" type="button" aria-label="Close project photo">×</button><figure><img alt="" /><figcaption></figcaption></figure><button class="adu-lightbox-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous photo">‹</button><button class="adu-lightbox-next" type="button" aria-label="Next photo">›</button></dialog>
 </div>
 <script>
  import '../scripts/adu';
 </script>
</Layout>
